    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `extract_layout.py` that extracts blocks, lines, tables, or layout elements from a document using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a service that offers document layout extraction. Amazon Textract is a suitable choice as it provides a robust API for extracting text and data from scanned documents. I will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to integrate with Amazon Textract. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789888347723,
          "start": 1789888345685
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bda8b655001kC495AMycUebaG",
